.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt UNLINK 1
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm unlink
.Nd remove a name
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
removes the name
.Ar file
with
.Xr unlink 2 ,
and does nothing else: it has no options, and refuses a directory.
.Xr rm 1
is the tool with options.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr link 1 ,
.Xr rm 1 ,
.Xr rmdir 1 ,
.Xr unlink 2
.Sh STANDARDS
.Nm
conforms to
.St -p1003.1-2008 .
